# Keeps the hand-written test suite out of the sdist.
#
# find_packages(exclude=["test", "tests"]) in setup.py only governs the wheel.
# setuptools' default sdist template picks up test*.py regardless, which shipped
# tests/test_*.py without tests/conftest.py -- so the sdist carried tests that
# could not run for want of the api_client fixture.
#
# Not generated by openapi-generator (absent from .openapi-generator/FILES), so
# this file survives regeneration.
prune tests
exclude requirements-test.txt
exclude openapi-generator-config.yaml
exclude .openapi-generator-ignore
prune .openapi-generator

# Ships the API changelog in the sdist. MANIFEST.in has no bearing on the
# wheel, where a top-level file cannot go at all; wheel consumers reach the
# changelog through the Changelog link in the package metadata.
include CHANGELOG.md
